"Drakes!\n"
"Fight on!\n"
"KILL!\n"
"Kill all that dare to oppose us!\n"
"Give no quarter and show no mercy!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/macros/deaths.cfg:239
msgid "No! Hartholar is dead!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/macros/deaths.cfg:243
msgid ""
"You must continue this quest without me, Malakar.\n"
"Although I die, the drakes - your people - still live on, and you are their Dominant.\n"
"You cannot falter now."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Morlin Ka
#: Flight_Freedom/macros/deaths.cfg:256
