#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:307
msgid "NOTE: Achievements are disabled if debug mode is enabled."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Necolag
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:324
msgid "NYIEEEEEEEE!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:337
msgid ""
"This is an army!\n"
"We cannot hope to take them ourselves.\n"
"But they will buy our lives dearly.\n"
"\n"
"Intendant Theracar.\n"
"I need you to warn the Jamolar Flight in the southeastern swamps."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Theracar0
#. [message]: speaker=Theracar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:346
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/09_The_Drake_Escape.cfg:287
msgid "At once, Malakar."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:350
msgid ""
"Kin!\n"
"\n"
"We did not know it when we slept last night.\n"
"Nor when we awoke this morning\n"
"But it has always been written that this is our final hour.\n"
"\n"
"Our first priority is to stop the cavalrymen who would intercept our message to the Jamolars."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:360
msgid ""
"Our second priority is to make sure that the children's children of these murderers still see our faces in their nightmares.\n"
"Attack!"
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:365
msgid "Defeat the cavalry leader"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:401
msgid ""
"Theracar!\n"
"Without their horses, you should be able to outdistance them in the hills.\n"
"Go!"
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:412
msgid "Move Theracar to the end of the southern stream"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:438
msgid ""
"Drakes!\n"
"Theracar is clear!\n"
"For the honor of the flight, let no human pass!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:453
msgid ""
"Drakes!\n"
"Theracar is clear!\n"
"\n"
"Now we follow the southern stream!\n"
"Without their horses, they will have trouble chasing us through the hills."
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:461
msgid "Move Malakar to the end of the southern stream"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:475
msgid ""
"Kin!\n"
"We must flee, at least for now!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:539
msgid ""
"I cannot abandon my flight!\n"
"As Dominant, honor demands I fight to the last!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:577
msgid ""
"Our fastest messenger is defeated!\n"
"Abandon the Eyrie!\n"
"Everyone turn south!\n"
"At least one voice must live to warn the Jamolar Flight!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:605
msgid "Haha! This one should fetch a hefty price at the market!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:635
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"The humans have overrun our lands!\n"
"Their cavalry blocks our escape!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:648
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"The humans have overrun our lands!\n"
"\n"
"Theracar, why are you still here?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/01_Desperate_Defense.cfg:657
msgid ""
"The humans have overrun our lands yet our messenger has escaped.\n"
"Our deaths will not be in vain."
msgstr ""

