#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/02a_Rebellion.cfg:124
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:152
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:157
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:74
