msgid "Defeat Prax III"
msgstr ""

#. [label]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:94
msgid "Armory"
msgstr ""

#. [label]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:98
msgid "Storeroom"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:428
msgid "Although the hatchlings were now safe, they had suffered grievous wounds, rendering most of them unable to fight. Many died from their wounds, rousing Malakar and the drakes into a ferocious bloodlust."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:433
msgid ""
"Soldiers!\n"
"Attack!\n"
"I expect each of you to bring back the scalp of a human!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:452
msgid "I shall have my revenge today!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:465
msgid "$unit.name became loyal!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:474
msgid "$unit.name became loyal! Further recalled units will also become loyal."
msgstr ""

#. [object]: id=drake_slave_spear_at_{X}_{Y}
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:517
msgid "Drake Spear"
msgstr ""

#. [object]: id=drake_slave_spear_at_{X}_{Y}
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:518
msgid "This weapon is excellent for a drake rising against its masters."
msgstr ""

#. [object]: id=drake_slave_spear_at_{X}_{Y}
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:519
msgid "This weapon is only fit for adult drakes."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:568
msgid "I wish this armor were drake-sized."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:621
msgid "So, this is why the mansion is haunted."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:646
msgid ""
"The circle is crackling with magical energy!\n"
"This is the work of a powerful necromancer."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:653
msgid ""
"The circle has darkened yet it still reeks of decay.\n"
"This is the work of a powerful necromancer."
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Spectre, id=necromancy_spectre
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:672
msgid "Ensorcelled Soul"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:678
msgid ""
"AAAAH!\n"
"My doom approaches!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: id=necromancy_spectre
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:683
msgid "Noble warriors, thank you for freeing me from this magical prison. I must now travel to my rightful place in the underworld. You may rest assured that my brethren will harm you no more."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:723
msgid "Ahh... tasty!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:739
msgid ""
"No, this is not... why am I drinking this?\n"
"I don't feel well."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:762
msgid "It appears to be nonsense about talking to skeletons..."
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Skeleton
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:774
msgid "Skeleton"
msgstr ""

#. [message]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:778
msgid "Like me?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:782
msgid ""
"Hm?\n"
"Yes, like... AAAAH!\n"
"A living skeleton!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:802
msgid "...who seems to be missing a few bones."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:818
msgid ""
"Rotten grape juice!\n"
"Yuck!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:838
msgid "It is just a box."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:854
msgid "It is another box."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:870
msgid ""
"Yet another box.\n"
"<i>*mumbles*</i> This is getting old..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:888
msgid "Wow, a wooden cube."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:905
msgid ""
"There is a fresh corpse here.\n"
"It appears to have been stitched together... it moves!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:921
msgid ""
"An abomination!\n"
"Help!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Manor, id=A key
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1028
msgid "Key"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1049
msgid "It seems he dropped a potion!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1075
msgid "This key could fit that trapdoor."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1081
msgid ""
"I seem to have found a key.\n"
"What it unlocks, I do not know."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1147
msgid "Perfect!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1151
msgid "Except I am standing on the trapdoor."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1163
msgid ""
"The trapdoor is locked!\n"
"Could that key fit?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1170
msgid "The trapdoor is locked!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1192
msgid "To think that our wretched 'master' could have bought us like cattle at this very desk..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1207
msgid "It looks like the baron kept a few coins here!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1282
msgid "This mansion is haunted!"
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Lieutenant, type=General, id=Omandro
#. [side]: type=Lieutenant, type=General, id=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1372
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:62
msgid "Omandro"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1396
msgid "Baron Prax III, you are hereby sentenced to death for treason against the Crown!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=mauler
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1413
msgid "Lieutenant, the drakes on the plantation have been dispatched."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=mauler
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1415
msgid "General, the drakes on the plantation have been dispatched."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03a_The_Manor.cfg:1420
msgid "Hunt down every drake in the manor as well. None must remain to reach Morogor."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Council_of_War
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/03b_Council_of_War.cfg:4
msgid "Council of War"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Caravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:4
msgid "Capturing the Caravan"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Elvish Marshal, id=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:38
msgid "Haloran"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Elvish Marshal, id=Haloran
#. [modify_side]
#. [side]: type=Elvish Marshal, type=Elvish Captain, id=Mandros
#. [side]: type=Elvish Captain, id=Einelen
#. [side]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:47
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:798
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:51
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/09_The_Drake_Escape.cfg:114
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/10b_Freezing_Foothills.cfg:107
msgid "Elvish Melrithian Force"
msgstr ""

#. [side]
#. [unit_type]: id=Caravan, race=human
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:106
#: Flight_Freedom/units/special/Caravan.cfg:5
msgid "Caravan"
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Caravan, id=theCaravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:113
msgid "Prax's Caravan"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Caravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:160
msgid "Destroy the caravan"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Caravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:162
msgid "Caravan is destroyed by wolves"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Caravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:163
msgid "Caravan escapes (reaches the western edge of the map)"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:371
msgid "After torching the mansion, Malakar headed out to intercept the caravan."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:381
msgid ""
"Our flight is now free.\n"
"I now have true warriors at hand, as well as the Dominant of the Jamolar!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:389
msgid ""
"Our flight is now free.\n"
"I now have true warriors at hand!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:565
msgid "Our next step towards home is simple: seize the caravan. It must not enter the hills!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:581
msgid "Scaled creatures! Do you know of Kogw?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:585
msgid ""
"No.\n"
"I have heard of no such name.\n"
"\n"
"Out of my way!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:592
msgid "Watch your tongue!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:596
msgid "Even the insulting are allowed safe passage through our forest. Do not try us, however, or you will find us unmatched in the woods. The rules are simple: take no longer than necessary, start no fires of any kind, and harm no living creature while within our borders."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:600
msgid "Very well, we will be gone from your lands shortly."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:604
msgid ""
"Remember, everyone, we take the caravan!\n"
"We have no quarrel with the elves."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Theracar
#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:618
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:624
msgid "Well, at least not yet."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:637
msgid "NOTE: From now on, since Hartholar is no longer critical to your cause, the game will not end if he is killed."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Morlin Ka
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:657
msgid ""
"Gar-Alagar does not approve of banditry!\n"
"We have suffered at the humans' hands.\n"
"But we must not lower ourselves to their level."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:663
msgid ""
"The Baron made this money on the backs of us drakes and the blood of our hatchlings!\n"
"We merely repay them in kind."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:681
msgid ""
"Our imprisonment was not kind to us.\n"
"It will be some time before we regain our former strength at arms.\n"
"But we stand ready to fight, Dominant!\n"
"Now and forever!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:694
msgid "Elves! Spread out through the forest! While these beasts have done nothing yet to provoke us, we must be wary!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=theCaravan
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:708
msgid "We're being robbed! Guards!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:721
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"The caravan has escaped into the hills!"
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Peasant, id=Trevor
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:742
msgid "Trevor"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Trevor
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:748
msgid " *gasp* Elves! Have mercy on me! I come from the Baron's manor, to the west, with terrible news! I need your shelter!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:752
msgid "We cannot offer you sanctuary, but we can promise you safe passage to the other..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Trevor
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:756
msgid "Winged beasts! They killed everyone, and burned everything! Fires! And bodies! And wings! And... scales... and... *collapses*."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Scout
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:793
msgid "Lord Haloran, my men have returned. The western hills are ablaze!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:802
msgid "Those fiends! Rally! Drive out the beasts! Do not rest 'til you cannot see their scales beneath our arrows!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:818
msgid ""
"$gold_amt gold!\n"
"This will go a long way toward our cause!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:824
msgid "ARRH! You fight like a crazed beast, and I wish to lose no more men. You have whatever it is you have come for - get out! Get out of our forest! If we ever cross paths again, it will be your death!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=questionb
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:838
msgid "What about the elves? They will pursue us!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:842
msgid ""
"I am aware.\n"
"But I fear that they will call reinforcements.\n"
"Which we cannot hope to fight."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:871
msgid "Guards! Rally to me!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:913
msgid ""
"The forest is crawling with elves!\n"
"We must focus on the caravan!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:929
msgid "Malakar, I have slain the elven chief!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:933
msgid ""
"Now is not the time to celebrate our kills!\n"
"Quickly, we must capture the caravan!\n"
"Before more humans or elves find us."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:953
msgid "You will not take us alive, lizards!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:986
msgid "We elves will remember this, lizards!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:993
msgid "This victory would taste sweeter if we had not wasted so much time fighting those elves..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:1017
msgid ""
"The caravan guards are slain!\n"
"Plunder the caravan quickly so we may make our escape!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:1034
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"The wolves have destroyed the caravan!\n"
"The elves approach on all sides!\n"
"Retreat!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=outrider_time_over
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:1080
msgid "Lord Haloran, we received your summons."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Haloran
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04a_Capturing_the_Caravan.cfg:1084
msgid "The drakes have brought death and flames to the forest. Kill them all!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Forest_of_Nightmares
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:4
msgid "Forest of Nightmares"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Revenant, id=SE Leader
#. [side]: type=Draug, id=NE Leader
#. [side]: type=Death Knight, id=SW Leader
#. [side]: type=Lich, id=NE Leader
#. [side]: type=Revenant, id=SW Leader
#. [side]: type=Spectre, id=Mal-Bronam
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:53
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:67
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:81
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:49
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:62
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:76
msgid "Undead Remnant"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Forest_of_Nightmares
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:86
msgid "Move Malakar to the southeast end of the road"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:119
msgid ""
"This forest, like all of Morogor, was once part of Mal-Bronam's domain.\n"
"Even though he has long since been vanquished, remnants of his power have survived.\n"
"This is one of them."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:125
msgid ""
"Once, this was a major hub in his domain, where many of his minions were trained.\n"
"His roads and castles remain to this day."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:130
msgid "I question why these remnants have been allowed to survive."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:134
msgid ""
"Simply put, no flight has yet laid claim to this area.\n"
"None have seen fit to cleanse it.\n"
"They are more interested in their petty feuds."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:141
msgid ""
"Still, many drakes have died here.\n"
"Due to the Harkon Mountains, the only practical routes from the High Temple of Gar-Alagar to Mogradesh are through the swamps of my flight, or the hills of the Ashtongue Flight to the south.\n"
"\n"
"Both the High Temple and Mogradesh are, by the Law of Kahn, tribeless cities.\n"
"Yet their citizens are often taxed or robbed because of their differing ancestries.\n"
"So some have tried their luck here."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:150
msgid "We must be vigilant for danger among this forest."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:154
msgid ""
"It has always been my opinion that the fog has claimed more lives than anything else here.\n"
"But we still must be wary.\n"
"\n"
"We must remain on the main road, marked by the myriad fortifications built by Mal-Bronam in his day."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:161
msgid ""
"Very well.\n"
"Let us leave this forest as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:244
msgid ""
"Undead... so this is why so many have died here.\n"
"\n"
"Drakes!\n"
"We will have to fight our way through!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:254
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:330
msgid ""
"There are the undead!\n"
"\n"
"Drakes!\n"
"We will have to fight our way through!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:319
msgid ""
"Undead...\n"
"So this is why so many have died here.\n"
"\n"
"Drakes!\n"
"We will have to fight our way through!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:367
msgid ""
"They have corrupted drakes for their evil ends!\n"
"Those wretched sorcerers!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rescuedA
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Finally, another drake.\n"
"My caravan was ambushed by the undead four days ago.\n"
"\n"
"I am from the High Temple.\n"
"But I shall serve whoever rescued me as long as I can leave this cursed place!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:404
msgid "Perhaps these undead are old slaves of Mal-Bronam."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rescuedA
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:408
msgid ""
"Indeed.\n"
"I fear that they are on the prowl today."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:413
msgid ""
"Drakes!\n"
"Continue traveling southeast but be on your guard!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:454
msgid "This cave is infested with bats!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:468
msgid ""
"Onward!\n"
"We must reach Mogradesh soon!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Morlin Ka
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:500
msgid ""
"Gar-Alagar smiles on us today!\n"
"The fog is breaking!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:507
msgid ""
"The fog is breaking!\n"
"We must have weakened the hold of the undead!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:529
msgid "We have cleared the undead from the forest!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:533
msgid ""
"We must press on before the humans catch us!\n"
"I fear that we may have tarried too long here."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/04b_Forest_of_Nightmares.cfg:553
msgid ""
"The undead are gaining too much power!\n"
"We are trapped!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Blue_River
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:4
msgid "Blue River"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Elvish Marshal, type=Elvish Captain, id=Mandros
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:43
msgid "Mandros"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Lieutenant, type=General, id=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:71
msgid "Wesnoth Royal Army"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:110
msgid "This must be the Blue River. I know you are all tired. We rest for ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: type=Pirate, id=Kogw
#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:124
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:230
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:288
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:302
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:329
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:455
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:470
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:514
msgid "Kogw"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=glidera
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:142
msgid ""
"Dominant Malakar.\n"
"There are humans on the other side of the river.\n"
"I cannot tell if they are looking for us or not."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:148
msgid "Spot of trouble with the army, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:152
msgid ""
"Who are you?\n"
"Someone!\n"
"Kill the human!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:158
msgid "All right, all right. I just thought you could use some help escaping from the, uh, humans."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:162
msgid "Explain yourself, softskin."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#. Kogw is using "adventurers" as a euphemism for "pirates" here:
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:167
msgid "As it happens, I'm the leader of a band of... adventurers. We're good sorts, but those damn elves have been after us for no good reason!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:171
msgid "You help us throw off the elves, and we'll join you."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:175
msgid ""
"Begone from here, softskin.\n"
"We have no need of you and no need of your aid."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:199
msgid "Kogw! By the order of Lord Mandros and the entire Elder Council of the Elven Nations, I order you to lay down your weapons and surrender at once!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:203
msgid "Look, friend, as one captain to another..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:207
msgid "I am the Dominant of this flight!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:211
msgid "If you've got trouble with Wesnoth's army, then no place here is safe. You need to leave these lands, and fast."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:215
msgid ""
"Ha!\n"
"Stupid human, you see not the wings on our backs!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:220
msgid "Kogw! This is your last warning!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:224
msgid "The ocean winds blow with great speed. You can't fly against them. And what will become of your spearmen, with their heavy armor?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:228
msgid "How DARE you insult my clashers, puny softskin!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:232
msgid "No offense meant, chief. It's just that you don't have the look of a seaman. Me, I know dozens of safe islands around here, and none of MY men will be abandoning their clothes and weapons to flee."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:236
msgid "Enough! Your time has come!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:240
msgid "You're flying blind, friend; and I bet these guys will chase you once they see you've abandoned your armor and weapons. You've gotta choose: fly off into the wind, half-naked and praying you find land; or you let me take you in style anywhere you want to go."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:244
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:452
msgid "*growls*"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:248
msgid ""
"You do speak some sense.\n"
"You have my cooperation for now.\n"
"But do not think for a moment that you have my trust."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:254
msgid "Stand aside, lizards!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:258
msgid ""
"We do not sail to some 'safe island.'\n"
"We sail to Morogor."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:263
msgid "Mor...? ...bloody... I mean, absolutely! We sail to Morogor the minute we get clear of these elves!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:288
msgid "The vengenance of the elves shall pursue you forevermore, pirate! We shall not rest until you face your justice!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=rider
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:302
msgid "Drakes! You have made an enemy of the elves this day!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Mandros
#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:313
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/12a_Rockfall.cfg:437
msgid "AAAAH!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:324
msgid "Well, then. That's that. We will aid you, Chief."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:328
msgid ""
"I must have a guarantee that you will not kill us while we sleep.\n"
"Swear on the fire of Gar-Alagar, king of the gods of Morogor.\n"
"Swear an Oath to me, Malakar of the Drakes, Dominant of the Kakatar Tribe!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:334
msgid "Upon the very eyes of the pirate gods I swear my loyalty."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:338
msgid ""
"Do not mention your 'gods' again, infidel human.\n"
"I see I shall have to teach you manners."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:344
msgid ""
"Understand.\n"
"You swear by Gar-Alagar, king of the gods of Morogor, in the future.\n"
"Or you will be sacrificed to him."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:351
msgid "You can now recruit Pirate Sloops."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:370
msgid "Now if only I'd had a chance to... no, you know what, never mind. Onward!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:384
msgid "Ahoy, mateys! Ready to sink some royals!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:397
msgid ""
"You!\n"
"I am Malakar, Dominant of these Drakes.\n"
"You will answer to me why you and your men pursue us."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:403
msgid "It is hardly by my wishes, drake. The Baron offered us a tremendous sum for slaves; we thought we could spare our own people if we gave you up, instead."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:407
msgid "I personally despise slavery; but I am sworn to the Crown, and the Crown is desperate."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:411
msgid ""
"You have not answered my question.\n"
"Why are we pursued?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:416
msgid "That, I do not know. Nearly a quarter of the Royal Army has been assigned to see that you are destroyed, even though most believe you've already done us a service by killing the necromancer Baron. The order makes no sense to me."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:420
msgid "What forces do you have with you?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:424
msgid "The nearest force advances from the south, but may be as far as a day behind."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:428
msgid ""
"Very well.\n"
"You have one minute to go.\n"
"If I ever see you again, there will be no mercy.\n"
"Go!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Omandro
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:435
msgid "Thank you, Malakar, Dominant of the Drakes, but I decline. I am still sworn to the crown, and have given my oath to the King. I must fight to the last."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:440
msgid "So be it."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:448
msgid "Wow. Well, Mal, we'd best be getting..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:456
msgid "... along before the winds shift. My ship is ready to go, when you are."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:460
msgid ""
"First we must bury the body of that one, Omandro.\n"
"The others were merely puppets.\n"
"But he was their leader."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=drakeb
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:476
msgid "With all due respect, Malakar, we hardly have the time to..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:480
msgid ""
"Silence!\n"
"\n"
"The humans hound us, enslave us, and kill our young.\n"
"They are our sworn enemies.\n"
"They will be destroyed every time our peoples meet!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:488
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/18_Return_to_Morogor.cfg:838
msgid " *gulp*"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:492
msgid ""
"However a few of them still have scant traces of honor.\n"
"We respect those with honor.\n"
"In the end, it is one thing that makes us different from them.\n"
"Bury their leader."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:501
msgid ""
"We respect those with honor.\n"
"This man had honor.\n"
"In the end, it is one thing that makes us different from them."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Kogw
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05a_Blue_River.cfg:531
msgid "It's... it's the entire Royal Third Fleet! We've been cut off!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Mogradesh
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:6
msgid "Mogradesh"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Lieutenant, id=ne_leader
#. [side]
#. [side]: type=General, id=se_leader
#. [side]: type=General, id=s_leader
#. [side]: type=General, id=Hago
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:49
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:78
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:92
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:122
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:141
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:57
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:55
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:66
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:77
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:90
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/09_The_Drake_Escape.cfg:53
msgid "Wesnoth Expeditionary Force"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Drake Flare, id=w_leader
#. [side]: type=Drake Flameheart, id=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:161
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:205
msgid "Mogradesh Drakes"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Drake Flameheart, id=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:182
msgid "Tenbakar"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Mogradesh
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:215
msgid "Death of Tenbakar"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Mogradesh
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:216
msgid "Invasion of Mogradesh's inner keep"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:272
msgid ""
"Mogradesh shall not fall.\n"
"Its walls are solid stone.\n"
"Enchanted by the magi of the Citadel."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:278
msgid ""
"Hail, Dominants!\n"
"\n"
"We have been trapped for days.\n"
"Already we are at the brink of starvation.\n"
"Help us to break the siege!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:286
msgid ""
"If Mogradesh falls, Malakar, none of northern Morogor will be safe.\n"
"We must attack!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:291
msgid ""
"Tenbakar!\n"
"We will drive off the humans.\n"
"Just hold them at bay until we arrive."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:305
msgid ""
"All able-bodied drakes!\n"
"\n"
"I call upon the pledges you have given to your flights, to your families, and to me.\n"
"Now, with everything you have left, attack.\n"
"Yes, their swords and arrows will sting.\n"
"But not one of us shall go to our graves today knowing that we let the softskins take Mogradesh.\n"
"Without first paying with every drop of blood we can wring from them!\n"
"\n"
"By honor and by Gar-Alagar, forward!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:326
msgid ""
"Retract the drawbridge!\n"
"Quickly!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:355
msgid "The humans are setting up strange war machines!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:359
msgid ""
"They are ballistas, like those on the humans' ships!\n"
"Drakes!\n"
"Dispatch them quickly before they destroy Mogradesh!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:525
msgid ""
"The ballistas are firing!\n"
"Destroy them!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:533
msgid ""
"Our walls are failing!\n"
"Hurry!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:879
msgid "Dump the boiling oil!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:954
msgid "ARRRRGH!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:976
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"Without him I cannot hope to prevail!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=w_leader
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:992
msgid ""
"Drakes!\n"
"You must hold the walls!\n"
"My death will not be in vain."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1008
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"Mogradesh has fallen!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1026
msgid "Mogradesh is secure and its walls undamaged."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1032
msgid "Finally, Mogradesh is secure."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Tenbakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1038
msgid ""
"Northern warriors, thank you for saving us today from the spears and swords of the humans.\n"
"My soldiers and I must remain and defend this fortress.\n"
"I pledge what treasure we have to you and your cause."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1053
msgid "You receive $reward_amt pieces of gold!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1060
msgid ""
"Thank you.\n"
"\n"
"Drakes!\n"
"For now, we rest and reprovision.\n"
"Tomorrow we fly at dawn!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/05b_Mogradesh.cfg:1116
msgid ""
"The humans have sent reinforcements.\n"
"Mogradesh is still not secure!\n"
"We are doomed!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Southern_Shore
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:4
msgid "Southern Shore"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Drake Chieftain, id=Malakar
#. [side]: type=Pirate Galleon2, id=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:29
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:38
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:30
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/17a_Blockade.cfg:30
msgid "Skullbone Pirates"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Dreadnought, id=Luna
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:36
msgid "Luna"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Dreadnought, id=Luna
#. [side]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:50
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:84
msgid "Wesnoth Royal Navy"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Southern_Shore
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:54
msgid "Sink the Luna"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Southern_Shore
#. [scenario]: id=Open_Ocean
#. [then]
#. [else]
#. [scenario]: id=Landfall
#. [scenario]: id=Blockade, race=ship
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:55
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:56
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:282
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:290
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:743
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:121
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/16_The_Exodus.cfg:284
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/17a_Blockade.cfg:121
msgid "Destruction of the Unforgiver"
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: id=Unforgiver, type=Pirate Galleon2
#. [side]: type=Pirate Galleon2, id=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:84
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:29
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08a_Landfall.cfg:19
msgid "Unforgiver"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:118
msgid "After securing the Blue River, Malakar boarded the pirates' flagship, the Unforgiver, and set sail for Morogor."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:125
msgid "Omandro had been wrong, however, and the human reinforcements were much closer than he had thought."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:132
msgid "Just as the Unforgiver cleared the coast, it was intercepted by the Royal Navy."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Luna
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:139
msgid "This is Commodore Lanck of the Wesnoth Royal Navy Ship Luna. In the name of the King, lower your sails and prepare to be boarded."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:144
msgid "(Malakar) Never!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:149
msgid "(Kogw) Uh, Mal...?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Luna
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:153
msgid "So be it. Prepare to be sunk!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:180
msgid "(Kogw) Broadside! Fire!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:198
msgid "(Kogw) Shiver me timbers!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:217
msgid "Their ships burn like dried brush!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:222
msgid "(Malakar) Kogw, perhaps we could we ignite your pirates' ballista bolts when you shoot them."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:227
msgid "(Kogw) Sounds like a good plan!"
msgstr ""

#. [effect]: type=fire
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:236
msgid "fire ballista"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:280
msgid "(Malakar) How fitting, Kogw, that humans should suffer in slavery to serve us."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:295
msgid "Sound the drums! Ramming speed!!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=shipa
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:318
msgid "The Luna is sinking! All hands, prepare for emergency boarding!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Luna
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:322
msgid "Save the highest-ranking officers first!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:329
msgid "(Kogw) Now, while they're distracted! Full sails south! Let's leave Wesnoth for good!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06a_Southern_Shore.cfg:351
msgid "(Kogw) Malakar... it's the entire Royal Third Fleet! We're surrounded!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Mountain_Crypt
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:4
msgid "The Crypt of the Mountains"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Lich, id=NE Leader
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:39
msgid "Mal-Troyam"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Spectre, id=Mal-Bronam
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:67
msgid "Mal-Bronam"
msgstr ""

#. [event]: id=Quemar
#. [event]
#. [scenario]: id=Mountain_Crypt
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:303
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:448
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:562
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:80
msgid "Move Malakar to the southern end of the valley"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=$branchb_narration_recipient
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:116
msgid "I have never seen such land as this, with mountains taller than the strongest gliders fly."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:120
msgid ""
"We are within a valley in the Harkon Mountains.\n"
"One of only a few where drakes can survive.\n"
"However, this land is, some say, cursed."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=$branchb_narration_recipient
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:126
msgid ""
"I must ask regarding the nature of this curse.\n"
"And whether we can avoid it by a different route rather than to traverse this valley."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:131
msgid ""
"We are at the site of the battle between Kahn and Mal-Bronam.\n"
"The site where our ancestors defeated that lich and won this island.\n"
"\n"
"However when he died, the land itself rejected his very essence.\n"
"These mountains rose to incredible heights.\n"
"Because of the mountains, we may only cross here, in this valley."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:140
msgid ""
"We should leave this valley as quickly as possible.\n"
"Not only are the humans conquering Morogor as we speak, I have learned to fear even the dead undead.\n"
"I am sure that we all remember the Forest."
msgstr ""

#. [event]: id=Quemar
#. [then]: type=Fire Dragon, id=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:159
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/18_Return_to_Morogor.cfg:705
msgid "Quemar"
msgstr ""

#. [then]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:193
msgid ""
"Fellow drake!\n"
"Of what flight are... a magus?!?"
msgstr ""

#. [else]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:197
msgid "Drake! Of what flight are... a magus?!?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:202
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"I am Quemar, a magus of the Citadel.\n"
"I was sent here by headmaster Quahgakar to scout the undead remnant here.\n"
"But I never anticipated their power.\n"
"Apparently, something has roused them from their sleep."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:210
msgid ""
"Perhaps I can explain.\n"
"Humans have invaded Morogor in several places and butchered my daughter.\n"
"They are slaughtering drakes by the score as we speak.\n"
"Meanwhile your magi play with fire in the citadel!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:217
msgid ""
"I know full well of the apathy that you speak of.\n"
"For some reason, many of my colleagues have lost their ardor.\n"
"I remember, when they first began their training, how eager they were for knowledge.\n"
"Their inquisitiveness, their passion.\n"
"\n"
"But they have recently taken to pursuit of strange magics and even perverse depravity.\n"
"They neglect their studies and withdraw from life.\n"
"They believe that their status as magi places them above all other drakes.\n"
"And even above civilization and basic morality.\n"
"\n"
"Only Quahgakar seems to still carry the torch of Freon.\n"
"Only Quahgakar, and I."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:232
msgid ""
"Yet the Magi are more powerful than ever.\n"
"\n"
"If you can reach them, they can form a convocation, with enough power to annihilate a thousand human armies.\n"
"However their defenses are formidable.\n"
"You will have to penetrate them.\n"
"\n"
"I shall help you.\n"
"But you will inevitably lose many.\n"
"A great many."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:244
msgid ""
"We must reach the Magi.\n"
"All of Morogor depends on it.\n"
"\n"
"Quemar, inform me of your powers."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:283
msgid ""
"I can create flame and frost with my hands and fire.\n"
"I can control the magics around us.\n"
"I can shape conduits with the ethers that surround us.\n"
"\n"
"With these tools, I can launch fires from vast distances.\n"
"Fires that can consume the tallest trees in mere moments."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:292
msgid ""
"Your assistance honors us.\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:297
msgid ""
"However, we must vanquish Mal-Bronam's restless spirit.\n"
"Unless his evil is banished from this realm, the convocation cannot form."
msgstr ""

#. [event]: id=Quemar
#. [event]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:302
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:447
msgid "Defeat Mal-Bronam"
msgstr ""

#. [event]: id=Quemar
#. [objectives]
#. [scenario]: id=Citadel
#. [event]: id=apprentice_1, id=apprentice_2, id=apprentice_3, id=apprentice_4
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:306
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:547
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:753
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:69
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:364
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/08b_Apocalypse.cfg:757
msgid "Death of Quemar"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:399
msgid "A curtain of darkness descends from the mountains, cloaking the entire valley."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:425
msgid ""
"The undead have found us.\n"
"\n"
"Remember, Mal-Bronam must be our target.\n"
"He will only possess a remnant of his former power.\n"
"Nonetheless he will remain a dangerous foe."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:435
msgid ""
"That darkness...\n"
"It must be Mal-Bronam!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:442
msgid ""
"Drakes!\n"
"Use the mountains for cover and defend yourselves!\n"
"We must escape the valley!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:519
msgid ""
"Mal-Bronam has finally been defeated.\n"
"The darkness is already fading.\n"
"The undead are melting away.\n"
"\n"
"We must reach the citadel quickly to begin the convocation!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:618
msgid "We must defeat Mal-Bronam first!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:624
msgid "We must hurry before Morogor is overrun by the humans!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:628
msgid ""
"Yes, but we must plan our strategy.\n"
"The Citadel will not be easy to breach."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:633
msgid ""
"We will, Quemar, we will.\n"
"May Gar-Alagar be with us."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/06b_The_Crypt_of_the_Mountains.cfg:660
msgid ""
"We have tarried too long...\n"
"We cannot reach the citadel in time!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Open_Ocean
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:4
msgid "The Open Ocean"
msgstr ""

#. [side]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:49
msgid "Sea Monsters"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Open_Ocean
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:55
msgid "Move the Unforgiver to the bottom"
msgstr ""

#. [set_menu_item]: id=control_thunder_sound
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:231
msgid "Toggle Thunder Sound Effects"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:282
msgid "(Kogw) Welcome to the Sea of Webs, boys and girls, home to the nastiest beasts you're likely to find this side of an undead family reunion."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:287
msgid ""
"(Malakar) None will obstruct our passage.\n"
"We will kill anything that tries to stop us!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:293
msgid "(Kogw) Good plan! Let's round up every monster in the ocean, and a few of the larger fish, and fight them one-on-one!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:298
msgid "(Malakar) Only the ones that oppose... do not mock me, thinskin."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:303
msgid "(Kogw) Heh-heh, I'm the one with thin skin, now? Keep the Unforgiver oriented South, men, and keep us well clear of the larger monsters! If we don't get wrapped up fighting, we should have more than enough time to be out of here before that storm hits."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:308
msgid "(Malakar) I can scarcely believe that you would let mere rain stop you."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:313
msgid "(Kogw) Spend enough time on the waves, Mal, and you can read the waves and the wind like a book. This place is right in the path of Heaven's own fury, and we've got to be gone before then."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:330
msgid "(Pirate) Incoming! Monsters!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:335
msgid "(Kogw) Hold your course!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:410
msgid "(Kogw) Full speed thataway!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:418
msgid "(Kogw) A shame we lost a member of our fleet in this storm, but I suppose it couldn't be helped. Onwards!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Unforgiver
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07a_The_Open_Ocean.cfg:430
msgid "(Kogw) We'll never outdistance this storm, and it's gaining strength by the minute! We're doomed!"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Citadel
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:4
msgid "The Obsidian Citadel"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Drake High Magus, id=Taqkar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:52
msgid "Taqkar"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Drake High Magus, id=Taqkar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:62
msgid "Obsidian Citadel"
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=Citadel
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:66
msgid "Move a unit to the Citadel"
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#. [scenario]: id=Citadel
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:548
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:754
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:70
msgid "Death of Taqkar"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:146
msgid "We have reached the Obsidian Citadel!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=$branchb_narration_recipient
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:150
msgid ""
"Now we must fight our way to it.\n"
"Why does ice fall from the sky here?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:155
msgid ""
"That ice is called snow.\n"
"It accompanies much of the Citadel's high magic.\n"
"\n"
"I have no doubt that they have scryed us traveling here.\n"
"They are ready."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:163
msgid "What will we have to fight?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:167
msgid ""
"The Magi will bring many enchantments to bear.\n"
"We will have to contend with magical sentinels.\n"
"And possibly the land itself."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:367
msgid "A great voice emanates from the tower."
msgstr ""

#. [message]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:385
msgid ""
"Hear, intruders!\n"
"You must face the four tests of the elements:\n"
"Air, fire, earth and water!\n"
"Only the worthy shall pass!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:517
msgid ""
"This was once a traditional initiation rite that all Magi undergo.\n"
"However my colleagues have twisted it into a blasphemous weapon."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:522
msgid "You must reveal the dangers of this trial."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:526
msgid ""
"These trials consist of magical manifestations of the four fundamental elements.\n"
"The trial of air will pit us against creatures of the winds that will attack with lightning and chill."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:531
msgid "Whatever we face, we must reach the Citadel!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:535
msgid ""
"First we must banish the four guardians that orbit the Citadel.\n"
"Then the way will be open.\n"
"\n"
"But beware.\n"
"Should we approach the Citadel while the guardians still stand we shall surely perish."
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:544
msgid "Kill the elemental guardians ($dead_guardians / 4)"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Taqkar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:677
msgid ""
"Fool!\n"
"Now you die!\n"
"The elements, they strengthen me!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:719
msgid "We must defeat the guardians first!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Hartholar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:737
msgid "The guardians have been dealt with!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:741
msgid ""
"Onward!\n"
"Seize the Citadel!"
msgstr ""

#. [objectives]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:750
msgid "Move a unit next to the Citadel"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Malakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:767
msgid "Quemar, we have reached the Citadel."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:773
msgid "Quemar casts a great spell!"
msgstr ""

#. [event]: id=Quahgakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:778
msgid "Quahgakar"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quahgakar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:791
msgid ""
"We must talk about the future of our existence.\n"
"I have commanded an end to the trial."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:830
msgid ""
"I feel an anger surging through me!\n"
"An urge to rend and kill!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:837
msgid "Unit gains 1 more round of all attacks!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:883
msgid "I feel my mind expanding... the winds around me obey my command!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:889
msgid "Unit's attacks become magical! (70% chance to hit)"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:935
msgid ""
"The energy imbues my muscle and sinew...\n"
"I feel more flexible than ever!\n"
"I shall reach new heights of greatness!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:943
msgid "Unit gains the skirmisher ability! (ignore enemy zones of control)"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:989
msgid ""
"I feel a connection to life around me!\n"
"It is as if I can draw essence from the decay of others!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:996
msgid "Unit's attacks gain the drain ability!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1036
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"Too much power...\n"
"It is tearing me apart!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1099
msgid ""
"Such power!\n"
"I cannot absorb more lest it should unmake me."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1106
msgid ""
"You have absorbed great power.\n"
"Take caution that you are not consumed by it!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1145
msgid ""
"The trial of fire will confront us with living flames.\n"
"These will seek to turn our inner fires against us."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1154
msgid "The trial of earth will transform the very ground we stand on or fly over into an adversary."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1162
msgid "The trial of water will attack us with beings of water that will attempt to douse our internal flames."
msgstr ""

#. [message]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1412
msgid "The lava rises around me!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1416
msgid ""
"Those who are overcome by lava shall not be harmed by it.\n"
"This is the one boon granted to Aspirants.\n"
"But know that any who presume to enter the flames,\n"
"Shall be consumed at once."
msgstr ""

#. [message]
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1448
msgid ""
"The air is thin...\n"
"My fire flickers...\n"
"I am unable to fight...\n"
"I must descend immediately!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1470
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"He was a focal point of the trial.\n"
"With his death the unchained elements will consume us all!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Quemar
#: Flight_Freedom/scenarios/07b_The_Obsidian_Citadel.cfg:1484
msgid ""
"The citadel has become impenetrable.\n"
"We have failed."
msgstr ""

