#: Flight_Freedom/units/fake_units.cfg:11
msgid "Drake Chieftain"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Drake Chieftain, race=drake
#: Flight_Freedom/units/drakes/Chieftain.cfg:25
msgid "Drake Chieftains are leaders among their flights, typically drawn from particularly gifted Aspirants. Skilled in the use of both their sword and their internal fire, they are also trained from a young age to lead their fellow Drakes into battle."
msgstr ""

