#. [unit_type]: id=Drake Lord, race=drake
#: Flight_Freedom/units/drakes/Lord.cfg:26
msgid "A Drake Lord is typically the Dominant of a powerful and respected flight. He wields a sword doused in flaming naphtha against which few foes can stand. Coupled with his mastery of his internal fires, a Drake Lord is an enemy few would dare to fight."
msgstr ""

#. [variation]
#: Flight_Freedom/units/drakes/Lord.cfg:235
msgid "Armed Drake Lord"
msgstr ""

#. [variation]
#: Flight_Freedom/units/drakes/Lord.cfg:236
